\" class=\"about-offer-content\"><div id=\"menuleftcontent\" class=\"menu-left-content\"><ul id=\"menu\"><li class=\"active ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">About the offer</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined ng-star-inserted\">chevron_right</span><!----></a></li><!----><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms &amp; Conditions</span><!----><!----></a></li><!----><!----></ul></div><div class=\"right-content\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offer-rte\">\n<div id=\"#abouttheoffer\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>About the offer</h2>\n<span class=\"expire-note\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span>Valid until\n30 Sep 2026</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p>Earn more with every step towards your next journey.</p>\n<p>Book an eligible stay through HalalBooking and enjoy double AlFursan Miles during the campaign period — Miles that bring your next trip closer and stay with you as you explore the world.</p>\n<p>Choose your booking and enjoy your reward:</p>\n<p>Every eligible accommodation booking made between 1 September and 30 September earns you double AlFursan Miles; a travel reward that moves you forward and stays with you on every journey ahead.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n</div>\n<h3>Offer period</h3>\n<p>The offer is valid from 1 September to 30 September 2026.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"#termsandconditions\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h3>Terms and Conditions</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<ul class=\"my-custom-list\">\n    <li>Offer <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://halalbooking.com/partners/alfursan\" target=\"_blank\">terms and conditions</a> apply.</li>\n    <li>HalalBooking terms and conditions apply.</li>\n    <li>AlFursan Program terms and conditions apply.</li>\n    <li>Eligible members will earn double Miles for any accommodation booking made between 1 September and 30 September (inclusive). The double Miles are calculated on the booking value (excluding taxes and fees) at the member's base earning rate for their membership tier at the time of booking.</li>\n    <li>This promotional offer cannot be combined with any other partnership, promotional, or bonus offers unless explicitly stated otherwise by HalalBooking.</li>\n    <li>All other programme terms and conditions remain in full effect, including eligibility criteria, earning conditions, exclusions, and the annual 100,000 Miles cap.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}